  </section>

  
  <section>
    <sectiontitle>Madness</sectiontitle>
    <p>
      Generally new Aspects for a character are chosen cooperatively by the
      party with the intent to generate interesting social dynamics within the
      game. Madnesses are a type of aspect that are imposed upon the player by
      the GM. While aspects are generally a two edged sword, madnesses are
      usually a curse.
    </p>
    
